{"id": "adv-7-packing-size-ambiguity", "tags": ["adversarial"], "input": "Give me 4 boxes of prawns 500g pack and 2 trays of eggs 30s", "expected": {"items": [{"product_name": "prawns", "quantity": 4, "unit": "boxes", "packing_size": "500g"}, {"product_name": "eggs", "quantity": 2, "unit": "trays", "packing_size": "30s"}], "delivery_location": null, "delivery_date": null}, "note": "Two measurements per item. The ordering amount is the quantity; the descriptor is the packing size. KNOWN AMBIGUITY: \"500g\" vs \"500g pack\" - see reg-2. This case exists to keep that ambiguity visible rather than hidden."}
